<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lion to post annual result on Oct 31.</title>
<headline>Lion to post annual result on Oct 31.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lion Nathan Ltd said on Friday it would post its annual profit on Thursday, October 31.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
